WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.869
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:04.771
We hope you're doing well.
And now, if you don't mind,

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:06.172
we are going to get to the news.

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:09.042
Former President Trump
on Saturday said

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:11.845
that the 2020 election
should be overturned

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:14.113
and the Constitution
should be terminated.

00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:15.881
Well, I'll say this for him --

00:00:15.881 --> 00:00:18.418
he does give a memorable wedding
toast.

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:20.686
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.686 --> 00:00:22.889
Tomorrow is
the Georgia Senate runoff,

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:24.723
and unfortunately
Herschel Walker's vote

00:00:24.723 --> 00:00:26.526
isn't going to count.

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:29.962
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.962 --> 00:00:32.632
President Biden said on Friday
the Democrats must win

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:34.133
the Georgia Senate runoff
to avoid

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:35.968
a 50-50 split
in the chamber.

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:38.437
"But that would mean the end
of my presidency,"

00:00:38.437 --> 00:00:40.206
said Joe Manchin.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.175
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:44.744
After she was kicked off
a Spirit airlines flight,

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:47.113
former New Jersey governor
Chris Christie's niece,

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:50.449
Shannon Epstein,
reportedly injured six deputies

00:00:50.449 --> 00:00:53.319
while resisting arrest,
including kicking an officer

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.655
in the groin, which can only
mean one thing.

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:56.823
She's running.

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:59.559
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:01.760
During last night's reception
at the White House

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:04.197
for Kennedy Center honorees,
President Biden praised

00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:07.233
the band U2 and said their music
has "changed the world."

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:10.603
Damn, I knew Biden was old, but
I didn't know he was that old.

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:13.640
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:17.677
New York City recently posted
a job listing

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:20.446
for a Director of
Rodent Mitigation,

00:01:20.446 --> 00:01:23.850
which will pay up to
$170,000 a year.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:27.320
Wow, $170,000 a year to say,

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.856
"Maybe don't serve dinner
in the gutter."

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:32.491
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.491 --> 00:01:36.763
Might that mitigate?

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:39.231
According to the latest numbers,
crime on New York's subway

00:01:39.231 --> 00:01:42.068
last month decreased by 13%
because it's hard to commit

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:44.203
a crime if you can't move
your arms.

00:01:44.203 --> 00:01:47.072
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.072 --> 00:01:50.343
Rapper Bad Bunny was named
Spotify's most streamed artist

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:51.878
worldwide in 2022.

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:53.446
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:56.249
No word yet on what he's doing
with his $6.

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:59.319
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:02.655
A tortoise named Jonathan

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:06.359
that lives on the island of
St. Helena recently celebrated

00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:11.197
his 190th birthday with
his 140-year-old trophy wife.

00:02:11.197 --> 00:02:13.332
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.332 --> 00:02:18.638
Everyone's laughing at you,
Jonathan!

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:21.374
And finally, amid the chaotic
pre-sale for Taylor Swift's

00:02:21.374 --> 00:02:24.477
The Eras tour, more than
two dozen fans recently filed

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:27.112
a lawsuit against Ticketmaster's
parent company, Live Nation,

00:02:27.112 --> 00:02:28.214
for unlawful conduct.

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:30.583
And while a trial is still
a long ways off,

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:32.885
pre-sale tickets
are already available.

00:02:32.885 --> 00:02:34.253
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.253 --> 00:02:35.755
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

